{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-chick-c-toy-sold-via-amazon-2602-0270","content_id":"dc47c434-8689-42a5-85f3-c09084ec462b","description":"Product Recall for Chick C Toy presenting a high risk of choking and burns.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"82f26c5a-cf44-49a0-882b-1fea1690ac40","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-08-11T11:53:22+01:00","id":"82f26c5a-cf44-49a0-882b-1fea1690ac40","title":"Link to Product Image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-08-11T11:53:22+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a7aff22bbafcd1db3b6e3fa/2602-0270-product-recall-chick-c-toy.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Chick C Toy sold via Amazon</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a high risk of choking as small parts can detach during use.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users by Amazon.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Toys – Dolls/Soft Toys (Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Amazon ASIN</td>\n      <td>B0GDFVK4CB</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Other Product Identifiers</td>\n      <td>X002HCRWDF, 200514383</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>White soft toy chick with red trim and orange plastic feet. Product description includes “Toy Dogs for Kids”.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_82f26c5a-cf44-49a0-882b-1fea1690ac40\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a7aff22bbafcd1db3b6e3fa/2602-0270-product-recall-chick-c-toy.pdf\">Link to Product Image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a high risk of choking as the black plastic eyes can detach or break off during reasonably foreseeable use, creating small parts that fit entirely within a small parts cylinder. These small parts pose a choking risk to young children, particularly those under 36 months of age who have a natural tendency to explore objects by placing them in their mouths.</p>\n\n<p>The product also contains easily accessible batteries. If a child accesses the batteries and places them in the mouth, the batteries may cause internal burns and injuries. Improvements are also required to product labelling and markings.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Toys (Safety) Regulations 2011.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The listing has been removed and the product has been recalled from end users by Amazon.</p>\n\n<p>Owners should stop using the product and keep it out of the reach of children. Contact the distributor you purchased from to request redress.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2602-0270</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"The Product Safety Report is now a Product Recall. ","public_timestamp":"2026-08-11T10:54:31Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-20T16:15:33Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"toys","product_measure_type":["removal-of-listing-by-online-marketplace"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-07-20","product_risk_level":"high"},"temporary_update_ty